# Newer-generation composer for the SDE display experiment.
#
# The fbdev port starts the fbdev-generation composer service from
# init.qcom.rc. When this file is installed, start the newer composer first so
# the framework's lazy HAL lookup binds to it, and retire the older service as
# soon as init brings it up so only one composer owns the display.

on late-fs
    start vendor.qti.hardware.display.composer

on property:init.svc.vendor.hwcomposer-2-1=running
    stop vendor.hwcomposer-2-1
